{maketoc}

! Introduction

Lojban MOO.  Weee!

Help can often be gotten on ((Lojban IRC)).

For general information on MOOs and MUDs and so on, see [http://www.mudconnect.com/mudfaq/|The MUD FAQ].  In particular, [http://www.mudconnect.com/mudfaq/mudfaq-p1.html#q5|How Do I Connect To A MUD], [http://www.mudconnect.com/mudfaq/mudfaq-p1.html#q7|Now that I'm connected, what do I do?], [http://www.mudconnect.com/mudfaq/mudfaq-p1.html#q14|What common commands are used on MUDs?], [http://www.mudconnect.com/mudfaq/mudfaq-p2.html#q1|What is a client?] and [http://www.mudconnect.com/mudfaq/mudfaq-p2.html#q5|What different clients are avialable?].

!! Connecting To The MOO

!!! Connecting Using a Graphical Client In Windows

I'm assuming that this will be what most users will want to do.  Please note that there is no security with this method; your password is being sent over the 'net in plain text.  You shouldn't use an important password on the MOO anyways.


! Reference Lists

* ((Lojban MOO Lojban Commands)) -- description of the commands available in Lojban

! To-Do Lists/Bug Reporting

Put stuff here that you'd like to see or that you know needs work.

* ((Lojban MOO General Bugs))
* ((Lojban MOO Translation-Related Bugs)) -- anything having to do with translation functionality
* ((Lojban MOO Untranslated Messages)) -- if you're in Lojban and you see something in English, it goes here
* ((Lojban MOO Feature Requests))
* ((Lojban MOO Help Files Translations)) -- if there's a particular help file you'd like to see translated

! Beta Release Checklist

So it seems to me that we're really close to being able to let the community at large know about this thing.  Here are the things ((Robin Lee Powell|I)) would like to see happen first:

# Turn this page into something helpful to people who want to use the MOO.  Login instructions, links to MUD FAQs, and so on.
# Make Lojban help files for at least the basics.  See ((Lojban MOO Help Files Translations)).

